OL,3,GNEWSAMum says teenage autistic son has
OL,4,Abeen abandoned and falling through
OL,5,Acracks in system
OL,6,
OL,7,FCherisse Lanigan feels her son has been
OL,8,F"abandoned and is falling through
OL,9,Fcracks in the system" because of a lack
OL,10,Fof support for young adults with
OL,11,Flearning difficulties.
OL,13,FCallan has autism and Attention Deficit
OL,14,FHyperactivity Disorder (ADHD), as well
OL,15,Fas anxiety and other behavioural
OL,16,Fissues.
