OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMum says teenage autistic son has
OL,4,Abeen abandoned and falling through
OL,5,Acracks in system
OL,6,
OL,7,FAfter recently turning 18, he took a
OL,8,Ftest which found he has an IQ above 70.
OL,9,FIn Northern Ireland, this means he
OL,10,Fcannot access adult disability
OL,11,Fservices, even thought he had been
OL,12,Fassessed as having special educational
OL,13,Fneeds as a child.
OL,15,FThe Northern Health Trust has said it
OL,16,Frecognises the approach "can present
OL,17,Fsignificant challenges" for individuals
OL,18,Fand families who do not meet the
OL,19,Feligibility criteria.
